[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0010","text":"蝴蝶的感觉越来越到位了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0020","text":"怎么说呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0030","text":"感觉衣服的形象和果穗的动作\n终于完美契合了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0040","text":"英雄们也是配合默契\n才能使出合体技的吧，就是那种感觉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0050","text":"……！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0060","text":"太好了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0070","text":"我好好变成蝴蝶了吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0080","text":"当然\n飘飘的，做得非常漂亮"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0090","text":"诶嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_10900200_03_0100","text":"我会努力变得\n更更更——漂亮的！"}]
